{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51286","headline":"句 六 · 李白","name":"句 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"借问单楼与同穴，可能银汉胜重泉。\n（以上王琦辑注《太白集》附录）（以上诸句及「庭中繁树乍含芳」一首，王琦云见於《海录碎事》、《锦绣万花谷》二书，「未详爲谁氏之作，其句法皆与太白不相似，亦皆以爲太白诗矣。\n」又推测或爲南唐时另一翰林学士李白撰。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51286.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51286","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}